  "question": {
    "text": "To know the resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi></math> of a galvanometer by half deflection method, a battery of emf <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow></msub></math> and resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is used to deflect the galvanometer by angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></math> . If a shunt of resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> is needed to get half deflection the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> are related by the equation:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let resistance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;is connected with galvanometer of resistance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi></math>, than</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0322_34d8a77cfb53.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 98px;\" /><br /><br />Now, as shown below figure a shunt&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;is connected in parallel with the galvanometer for half deflection in it, that is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, than</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0322_57c5bcbb5195.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 128px;\" /><br />As, shunt and galvanometer are in parallel&nbsp; then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></msub><mo>&#39;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></msub><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></msub><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>IS</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></msub><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>On, substituting the values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;in above equation<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
}